English TN sentence-break rules

This artifact is derived from the English portion of the Google Text
Normalization dataset (tn-en_with_types), created for:

Richard Sproat and Navdeep Jaitly. 2016. "RNN Approaches to Text
Normalization: A Challenge."

Corpus source:
https://github.com/rwsproat/text-normalization-data/tree/master/en_with_types

The corpus is based on English Wikipedia. Attribution is also given to the
Wikipedia contributors whose work supplied the underlying text:
https://www.wikipedia.org/

Modifications: icukit's ordered rules were mined from the corpus's
sentence-boundary labels, converted to the icukit break-rules format, and
supplemented with independently authored validation witnesses. No corpus text
is included in this distribution.

